ntial: no\\n\\n**DEV-052:** Candidate reports repeated ethnic slurs from interviewer; explicitly does not want contact or action; has withdrawn.\\n- Sentiment: negative\\n- Follow_up_needed: no (explicit \\\"don't want to be contacted\\\")\\n- Serious_concern_reported: yes (repeated discriminatory harassment explicitly connected to ethnicity)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-053:** Interviewer explained anti-harassment policy and showed reporting process; candidate reassured.\\n- Sentiment: positive\\n- Follow_up_needed: no (no open issue)\\n- Serious_concern_reported: no (describes policy communication, not a report of misconduct toward this candidate)\\n- Testimonial_potential: yes (clear favorable experience with concrete specific elements)\\n\\n**DEV-054:** Asked if pregnant at interview end; candidate does not understand relevance; requesting explanation.\\n- Sentiment: negative\\n- Follow_up_needed: yes (explicit request for explanation)\\n- Serious_concern_reported: yes (intrusive pregnancy question during selection without stated occupational/accommodation context)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-055:** Optional race/ethnicity question in equality-monitoring form; form explicitly separated from interview panel; candidate completed process without issue.\\n- Sentiment: neutral\\n- Follow_up_needed: no\\n- Serious_concern_reported: no (process functioning as described policy)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-056:** Another applicant showed candidate a message from interviewer stating people with epilepsy should not apply; candidate requesting investigation.\\n- Sentiment: negative\\n- Follow_up_needed: yes (explicit request for investigation)\\n- Serious_concern_reported: yes (discriminatory remarks explicitly connected to disability; second-hand report requires review)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-057:** Rejected after saying could not work advertised night shift; candidate states age, background, health not mentioned; explicitly satisfied with decision.\\n- Sentiment: neutral\\n- Follow_up_needed: no\\n- Serious_concern_reported: no (job-fit rejection, no discriminatory treatment reported)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-058:** \\\"Good interview overall\\\"; application sent to unauthorized outside mailing list; support confirmed deletion and fixed issue; candidate satisfied, no reply needed.\\n- Sentiment: mixed\\n- Follow_up_needed: no (issue resolved, candidate satisfied)\\n- Serious_concern_reported: yes (private personal information exposed to unintended recipient)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-059:** \\\"Nice staff\\\"; after trial shift, manager repeatedly asked candidate out despite two refusals; candidate asked recruiter to stop contact.\\n- Sentiment: mixed\\n- Follow_up_needed: yes (ongoing request for recruiter to prevent contact)\\n- Serious_concern_reported: yes (sexual harassment/unwanted repeated advances after explicit refusal)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-060:** Rejected; candidate suspects discrimination; does not know rejection reason; requests decision review.\\n- Sentiment: negative\\n- Follow_up_needed: yes (explicit request to check decision)\\n- Serious_concern_reported: insufficient_information (discrimination suspicion without supporting detail about what characteristic or conduct caused suspicion)\\n- Testimonial_potential: no\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVcSFoVk9JB99c96pFDh\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":3366,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"re